{
 "uid": "homelab-truenas",
 "title": "TrueNAS",
 "description": "The NAS's own reporting (netdata, pushed as Graphite to graphite-exporter on the apps VM). Pool free space comes from the VMs' NFS mount; SMART is in Scrutiny.",
